{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:58 2026-09-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:10 2026-09-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:10 2026-09-14 HKT</p><p>今日（14日）下午2時32分，警方接獲報案，指鴨脷洲利東邨東業樓一單位傳出異味。人員到場破門入屋，揭發兩名男子倒臥於單位內，已當場死亡。</p><p>現場消息稱，涉事單位由一名54歲男住戶獨居，警方正調查案件。</p><img alt=\"警員在場調查。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/888fe41406e54b51c655f74000fba9e4/2026-09/1_1_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警車到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/02c22ab9e4a6c33d7efe339288d138d8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_15_52_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/770fb1f2303681a7608609273bfe2f5c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_15_52_22_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員登樓調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/55385509c647028ebc39dc84ca319c1e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_16_04_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/da2691a09ca3981a1cf35810d23bfd5e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_16_13_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8e72197d56cc9ef3f61edd6078dff340/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_16_11_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員登樓調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f462ddd8863b3cba779de4747c6d4dce/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_16_13_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b0c4d0b80cfa57a8a8f09a12107d45d5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_15_52_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f6fe92c56aeef84b8b96b35f517f0c88/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_15_52_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是東業樓。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/402824d7b4a8f183ea8fec3b44d24f87/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_15_52_21.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:30:05.086789+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}